JIM RADZICKI: Hello everyone
and welcome to our session,

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:10.110
Enabling TELUS
International to Securely

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:14.070
Work from Anywhere with
itopia on the Google Cloud.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.239
I'm Jim Radzicki from
TELUS International.

00:00:16.239 --> 00:00:19.780
