all of us having our pets

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.320
there, as well.

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:40.320
So a little bit of that
positive experience

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.140
from the work at home
and some of the pets

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:44.130
at TELUS International.

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:47.140
So with that, I thank
you for joining us.

