00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:06.380
To take our joint
solution to the market,

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:08.930
to help companies
all over the world,

00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:12.980
to give their employees the
ability to work from home.

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:15.710
Thanks again for joining us
and for having us and allowing

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:18.490
us to tell our success story.

